# Trading at Lave, from the start of a game: buys food and firearms, is refused alien items and, with the
# last 0.1 credits, radioactives; then sells both, the firearms as contraband that makes the commander an
# offender. The menus read the cursor keys once each 100-tick poll, hence one key a row, 0.15 s apart.
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key F3; wait 0.5                   # Buy Cargo, its cursor on Food
key b; wait 0.2; key 5; key Return; wait 0.3
